    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Three grips so far, and only the first was built the way this chapter says diminished chords are built — the minor shape with the fifth dropped a fret. Does that recipe hold on the other three string sets, or is there somewhere on the neck it runs out of room?"
        }
